  "title": "The Best Barbecue Baked Beans",
  "description": "Chef John shows us the best recipe for barbecue baked beans includes bacon, pork shoulder, and an array of spices. Perfect for summer parties, BBQs, or potlucks.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
