    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make the best barbecue baked beans. First, soak the red beans in water overnight to give them some added volume. Add them into a simmering pot with onion, pork shoulder, and bayleaf. After transferring the meat and beans to a baking dish, pour in a sauce mixture containing bbq sauce, ketchup, apple cider vinegar, brown sugar, molasses, mustard, Worcestershire sauce, and seasoning. Bake it for around three hours and garnish it with green onions. It’s rich, flavorful, and will be a hit at the next backyard barbecue.",
